# Kernel tarballs this tree builds that Buildroot's own board/raspberrypi/patches/linux/linux.hash
# does not list. Calculated locally from the URL Buildroot downloads (the same method reproduces
# the hash Buildroot publishes for its commit 576cc10e...).
